      "content": "That makes sense. But if the technical hurdles like storage and grid upgrades are solvable with \"the right investments,\" doesn't that make the arguments against the bill essentially moot? If we already know how to fix the problems they're pointing out, isn't the opposition really just a matter of political willpower rather than actual substance?",
